      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{64cd505242b27e0961e4fd35|full_name} I guess I should add context as to why I even wish for LODs. The problem is not just the model of the avatar itself, but things added onto it with Modular Avatar and VRCFury (All kinds of prefabs, guns, props and so on). Impostors remove the functionality of prefabs all together. I personally make guns for VRChat, and LODs would be some of the greatest help to make my models optimised with distance. I really don't think this is arguable, most games use LODs, most of my latest worlds use LODs too, it's an all-around good method to optimise assets.",
