  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2026-06-12T13:00:09.899Z",
  "deleteID": null,
  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "I feel like this should be a no-brainer, allow LODs to be used on avatars to reduce the polygon amount by distance. You could essentially cut your avatar's polygons by three times with distance to reduce load on people.",
